--- !u!114 &955590617
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 955590616}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9b82723acb954704c950f2be5983528e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::KineticEnergy.UI.SectionIntroHud
  showHud: 1
  sections: {fileID: 1725534268}
  sectionTexts:
  - 'FOUNDATIONS

    Charge a launch and release to fire. Midair, hold the aim button
    to slow time and re-aim - the wheel or right stick dials the energy up and down.
    Ground pound with E / pad-West while airborne.


    Checkpoints are BUTTONS:
    land steeply or pound them, using at least the energy they show.'
  - 'MOMENTUM

    The ghost copy shows where a platform will be WHEN YOU LAND -
    aim at the ghost. The rotating wall''s broad faces carry you; its thin red edges
    cost energy.'
  - 'CROSSFIRE

    Beams shove you back and drain energy. The turret telegraphs,
    then fires a burst - cross while it reloads.'
  - 'AERIAL

    Flyers only die to a hit on the marked back cube; anything else
    staggers them and drops you on top. The tilted ledges will not hold a cling.'
  - 'SIEGE

    Guns on both flanks. The arena holds a cheap kill and an expensive
    one - check the pips before you commit the energy.'
  - 'GAUNTLET

    Everything at once. Energy is the real resource here: every kill
    has a price, and the meter''s marker shows whether this shot can pay it.'
  panelWidth: 440
