MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1012176929}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b78d2b2643066bd4c8dab4033ce5dbd6, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::KineticEnergy.Level.MergedEconomyController
  currentVariant: 4
  autoMaxEnergy: 0
  comboBaseRefund: 1
  comboStepPerLevel: 0.05
  comboWindowSeconds: 5.2
  comboMaxMultiplier: 2
  comboMeterDropPixels: 20
  comboMeterColor: {r: 1, g: 0.62, b: 0.1, a: 1}
  comboIdleColor: {r: 0.55, g: 0.55, b: 0.55, a: 0.9}
  firstLaunchBaseRefund: 0.9
  firstLaunchStepPerLevel: 0.05
  midairLaunchBaseRefund: 0.9
  midairLaunchStepPerLevel: 0.05
  dualSafetyTriggerFraction: 0.4
  dualSafetyCeilingFraction: 0.4
  totalLossBaseRefund: 1
  totalLossStepPerLevel: 0.1
  totalLossSafetyTriggerFraction: 0.4
  totalLossSafetyCeilingFraction: 0.4
  introKey: levelelements
  introText: 'LEVEL ELEMENTS TEST


    A straight run along one axis, introducing
    one element at a time. Pause > Sections jumps straight to any of them - you respawn
    there while you keep testing it.


    1 - BASICS: plain platforms.


    2 -
    MOVING PLATFORMS: while you aim, a ghost of the platform and a blue arrow show
    where it will be when your shot lands.


    3 - ROTATING WALLS: sticky faces
    that keep turning. Land on one and it carries you round with it.


    4 - LASERS:
    gates that blink on and off. Cross while they are turned off - touching a beam
    knocks you back and drains energy.


    5 - HUNTERS: they leap at you from a
    distance, even in midair, and dodge launches aimed at them. They show red when
    you can''t attack them. If they miss an attack, it leaves them open to be killed.
    They display purple then and can''t dodge.


    6 - TURRETS: fixed wall enemies
    that fire a burst of two shots, then cool down. The yellow flash is their wind
    up warning.


    7 - FLYERS: they hang forward with a pulsing spot on their
    back, that spot is the only spot where you can kill them. Hit them anywhere else
    and they are knocked out for a while. Afterwhich you land on their back and can
    ground pound them.


    CHECKPOINTS: the blue button on each section pad. Ground
    pound on it or crasht steeply from above, to activate.


    FALLING: if the
    combo window runs out while you are in the air, the aim is cut short and you
    fall down. Keep landing before the meter empties.


    Press any button to start.'
  safetyTriggerFraction: 0.4
  safetyCeilingFraction: 0.4
  regenPerSecond: 0.12
  regenOrangeFadeSeconds: 0.4
  wallLaunchStakeFraction: 0.3
  premiumBoundaryFraction: 0.4
  lockSettings: 1
  momentumLaunches: 1
  totalLossKeepFraction: 0.4
  dropPlayerWhenWindowExpires: 1
  regenWhileComboRunning: 1
  showHudTag: 0
  flightSettleSeconds: 0.25
  comboMeter: {fileID: 645746554}
